# Market indices
Weighted baskets of related items, each rebased to 100 when tracking began.

```table
Index              Items  Level  Change
-----------------  -----  -----  ------
Bars                   8   99.7   -0.5%
Food                   8   89.3   -9.6%
Herbs                 14  105.9   +5.9%
Logs                   9   95.9   -2.9%
Ores                   9  101.5   +0.9%
Overall               18  101.0   +1.0%
Potions                8  102.9   +3.2%
PvM gear              11   98.3   -1.8%
Runes                 14   95.8   -3.4%
Skilling supplies     12   85.7  -14.6%
```
=> /ge/indices#bars Bars
=> /ge/indices#food Food
=> /ge/indices#herbs Herbs
=> /ge/indices#logs Logs
=> /ge/indices#ores Ores
=> /ge/indices#overall Overall
=> /ge/indices#potions Potions
=> /ge/indices#pvm PvM gear
=> /ge/indices#runes Runes
=> /ge/indices#skilling Skilling supplies

Constituents are equally weighted unless stated otherwise. Equal weighting is used because it can be checked by hand against the published list.

